  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I accidentally posted my User Real Height from a Quick Menu settings screenshot to a VRChat Canny bug report as a public attachment for ~50 minutes - while illustrating the location of another Tracking & IK setting - without realizing I had revealed my User Real Height value unintentionally and by default.\n\nPhysical factors such as User Real Height may be considered as identifying personal data for a natural person.\n\nIt also appears \"User Real Height\" is not/cannot be obscured by the Streamer Mode safety setting.\n\nI would like to see the User Real Height value obscured by default (or as a privacy option), until clicked to view or adjusted up/down, or as part of the Streamer Mode safety setting.",
